WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Meet the real GODFIN desktop app with made-up data.

00:03.000 --> 00:10.400
Bring in Gmail transaction alerts or a supported bank statement.
Review every row before it changes your month.

00:10.400 --> 00:15.000
Correct a category once, and GODFIN can remember that merchant next time.

00:15.000 --> 00:23.900
See regular payments, goals, and clear reports,
while your money records stay on your computer.
